---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Features · House Designer"
  description="See what House Designer can do: sketch a floor plan, step into a live 3D view, and queue a photoreal render — free, in your browser, no signup."
>
  <section class="page">
    <span class="eyebrow">What you can do</span>
    <h1>From idea to layout, without the blanks.</h1>
    <p>House Designer gives you three things most early-stage design tools skip: a clean way to sketch, a way to see what the sketch means, and a way to get a finished-looking image out of it — free, with no download and no account required.</p>

    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card">
        <span class="number">PLAN</span>
        <h3>Draw rooms that make sense</h3>
        <p>Place walls, doors, and windows on a grid that respects real proportions. No measuring twice to catch a misaligned room — the plan stays honest as you edit.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="number">3D</span>
        <h3>Step inside the same model</h3>
        <p>Switch from the flat plan to a live 3D view, or split the screen and watch both update together. Spot problems that floorplans hide.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card">
        <span class="number">RENDER</span>
        <h3>Get an image worth sharing</h3>
        <p>Queue a photoreal, path-traced render of your design — a finished picture, not a screenshot of a live preview.</p>
      </article>
    </div>

    <section class="features-detail">
      <div class="feature-row feature-row--media">
        <div class="feature-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">Sketch without commitment</span>
          <h2>Try ten layouts in the time it takes to draw one.</h2>
          <p>Early design is about options, not precision. Move a wall, swap a room, test a different entrance — and keep the versions that work without cluttering your file.</p>
        </div>
        <figure class="feature-media">
          <img
            src="/screenshots/v2-03-app-plan-view.png"
            alt="2D floor plan view in House Designer, showing walls, rooms, and openings"
            width="1600"
            height="1000"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <figcaption>The plan view — a real screenshot, late prototype.</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-row feature-row--media">
        <figure class="feature-media">
          <img
            src="/screenshots/v2-04-app-3d-view.png"
            alt="Live 3D view of a room design in House Designer"
            width="1600"
            height="1000"
            loading="lazy"
            decoding="async"
          />
          <figcaption>The live 3D view — a real screenshot, late prototype.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="feature-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">Test before you build</span>
          <h2>See the room before the contractor does.</h2>
          <p>A live 3D view catches the awkward corner, the window that faces a wall, the hallway that feels tighter than the plan suggested. Fix it now, not during framing.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="feature-row">
        <div class="feature-text">
          <span class="eyebrow">Beyond the in-app preview</span>
          <h2>When a preview isn't enough, render it properly.</h2>
          <p>The live 3D view is for iterating fast. When you want a finished image — for a mood board, a family vote, or just to see it for real — queue a photoreal render of the same model.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="cta-section">
      <h2>Start with a blank plan.</h2>
      <p>No templates to undo. No defaults to fight. Just a grid, your ideas, and a clear path to a layout you can stand behind — free, no signup required.</p>
      <div><a class="button" href="https://app.buildmy.house">Start designing — it's free ↗</a></div>
    </section>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .features-detail {
    margin-top: 80px;
  }
  .feature-row {
    padding: 48px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .feature-row:first-child {
    border-top: none;
  }
  .feature-text h2 {
    margin: 16px 0 20px;
  }
  .feature-row--media {
    align-items: center;
    display: grid;
    gap: 48px;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }
  .feature-media img {
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    display: block;
    height: auto;
    width: 100%;
  }
  .feature-media figcaption {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
    font-size: .7rem;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }
  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .feature-row--media {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
  .cta-section {
    margin-top: 80px;
    padding: 60px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .cta-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .cta-section .button {
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
</style>
